{"title":"2007 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A quaternary “number” is an arrangement of digits, each of which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca55fb8eb826b85c01ca6f0a3b782cd439f00e85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0, 1, 2, 3.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"64\" height=\"16\" />\nSome examples: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96e6c6b536bf7b92adf2923bce85153c3754ef74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$001, 3220, 022113.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"137\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>(a) How many <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit quaternary numbers are there in which each of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/c/dbce1918021fbaf32f63344dd40acb93cfb5260f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0, 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"17\" /> appear at least once?\n</p><p>(b) How many <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />-digit quaternary numbers are there in which each of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/0/26017e8d71075036655628aa292989bbc8167380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0, 1, 2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> appear at least\nonce? Test your answer with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/3/2f370fd7cbd011641d1542cc095fed54cba85100.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3.$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>(c) Generalize.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/1/261c84737a6b4ee71ec88114057eff2061200377.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^6-2\\cdot3^6+2^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>(b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/a/f4a74b57c956982ecf2c822c906cbd08790fc180.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^n-3\\cdot 3^n+3\\cdot 2^n-1^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"182\" height=\"14\" /> \n</p><p>(c) Generalize\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2007 UNCO Math Contest II\">2007 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2007 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Re